# Testing / Observability Rules

1. Every new agent/tool/model contract needs unit and contract tests.
2. Emit mission_id, task_id, agent_id, evidence_id and trace_id where applicable.
3. Build replay tests for cross-domain incidents and handoffs.
4. Test missing/stale/conflicting data explicitly.
5. Test prompt injection inside external/tool-returned text.
6. Any production capability must define timeout, retry and failure behavior.
